# The image needs two files from this repository. An allowlist keeps the build
# context tiny and makes it structurally impossible for a credential, a session
# transcript or any other future file to reach an image layer.
*
!docker-entrypoint.sh
# The parent has to be un-excluded as well: a file below a directory that `*`
# matched stays out of the context otherwise.
!scripts/
!scripts/prune-platform-packages.js
